  chapterTitle: Three in the Morning
  weekContext: Week 6, postpartum
  obstacleText: "Severe sleep deprivation"
  mainTaskText: "Settling a crying baby to sleep"
  contentWarningText: This game explores the emotional and physical strain of pregnancy
    and early parenthood. You can exit at any time.
  showMeterIntro: 1
  meterIntroNote: "Move with the arrow keys or WASD, and press E to use things. While settling the baby, hold E and respond to the prompts: hold SPACE to rock and shush, tap Q to stay awake, and tap F to text back friends who are checking in."
